  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nnn= int(input())\r\nfor _ in range(nn):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    n*=3\r\n    l=list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    l.sort()\r\n    l=l[::-1]\r\n    pre=[0]*(n+1)\r\n    for i in range(n):\r\n        pre[i+1]=pre[i]+l[i]\r\n        \r\n    a=0\r\n   \r\n    \r\n    for x in range(n//3+1):\r\n        low=0\r\n        high=n//3-x\r\n        \r\n        while low < high:\r\n            mid=(low+high+1)//2\r\n            \r\n            pos=x+ 2*(mid-1)\r\n            end=n-2*x-(mid-1)\r\n            \r\n            if l[pos] + l[pos+1]>=3*l[end-1]:\r\n                low=mid\r\n            else:\r\n                high=mid-1\r\n        y=low\r\n            \r\n        pos=x+2*y\r\n        end=n-2*x-y\r\n        cur=2*pre[x]+pre[pos]+3*pre[end]\r\n        a=max(a,cur)\r\n    print(a)\r\n       \r\n        ",
